---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Drafts by Song." currentPath="/about">
  <article class="prose">
    <h1 class="article-title" style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">About</h1>

    <p>
      <strong>Drafts by Song</strong> is a personal space for working drafts,
      structured notes, and long-form essays.
    </p>

    <p>
      Entries are marked by stage—<code>note</code>, <code>draft</code>, or
      <code>essay</code>—and revised as models improve or counterexamples appear.
    </p>

    <h2>Colophon</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Built with <a href="https://astro.build">Astro</a> and static HTML/CSS.</li>
      <li>Math rendered with KaTeX; source hosted on <a href="https://github.com/draftsbysong/draftsbysong.github.io">GitHub</a>.</li>
      <li>Updates available via <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>.</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
